cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the associated study."
title: "Structure-Aware Generative Modeling of Warli Art Motifs from Limited Data Using DCGAN and WGAN-GP"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kannan"
    given-names: "Rajeswari"
repository-code: "https://github.com/virayupr/warli-dcgan-abstract-pattern-generation"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-08-26
keywords:
  - generative adversarial networks
  - DCGAN
  - WGAN-GP
  - Warli art
  - low-data image generation
  - structure-aware evaluation
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility resources for a three-seed comparison of DCGAN and WGAN-GP
  on 998 grayscale Warli human motifs, including multi-perspective evaluation
  using FID, SSIM, axial symmetry, LPIPS, connected-component descriptors,
  and nearest-neighbour analyses.
